Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, ca-certificates, iproute2, systemd, @ICU@, libssl3t64 | libssl3 | libssl1.1
Suggests: amneziageo-gui
Description: geo-aware VPN client - agent and console client
 AmneziaGeo sends only the traffic named by geo rules through an AmneziaWG
 tunnel and leaves the rest on the direct link.
 .
 This package carries the privileged agent that runs as a systemd service, the
 AmneziaWG engine it drives and the amneziageo console client with its
 full-screen console interface. It pulls in no desktop libraries, so it fits a
 headless server.
